title: "KineticAI-AWGC: A Computational Platform for Predictive Materials Design and the Kinetic Blueprint Framework"
abstract: >-
  Open computational materials-science platform integrating experimental
  datasets, kinetic modeling, and machine-learning workflows for
  spray-pyrolyzed apatite-wollastonite glass-ceramics. Computational
  foundation of the Kinetic Blueprint Framework for deterministic
  materials design.
